sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box rgba(31, 67, 77, 0.35) Rephora Mobile Client
        participant App as Flutter App
    end

    box rgba(34, 66, 41, 0.35) Spring Boot Monolith
        participant API as GraphQL API
        participant SessionEnd as EndSessionUseCase
        participant Habit as StudyHabitCalculator
    end

    box rgba(77, 57, 98, 0.22) DynamoDB
        participant DB as DynamoDB tables
    end

    rect rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.07)
        Note over App,DB: Synchronous completion path: the app needs the final payload for the completion screen
        App->>API: endSession(sessionId)
        API->>SessionEnd: Execute final session closure
        SessionEnd->>DB: study-sessions: load active session
        SessionEnd->>DB: users: load authenticated user
        SessionEnd->>Habit: Calculate daily seconds, streak, and study habit
        Habit-->>SessionEnd: StudyHabit snapshot
        SessionEnd->>SessionEnd: Calculate duration, score, accuracy, XP, level
        SessionEnd->>DB: user-stats: persist XP, streak, level, accuracy
        SessionEnd->>DB: study-sessions: mark COMPLETED
        SessionEnd-->>API: Completion payload
        API-->>App: Final score, XP, streak, level, and study habit
    end
